WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:15.536
"The guards are coming!"

2
00:00:15.896 --> 00:00:17.097
the servant repeated.

3
00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:20.620
"Uh-oh," said Vinnie.

4
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:26.045
"Someone must have seen us sneak into the palace," cried Mandy.

5
00:00:27.466 --> 00:00:29.108
Gildong's face was pale.

6
00:00:30.068 --> 00:00:33.131
"We will go to jail if they find us here," he said.

7
00:00:34.192 --> 00:00:35.373
The princess stood.

8
00:00:35.393 --> 00:00:37.094
"Don't worry!

9
00:00:37.495 --> 00:00:39.296
I have a plan," she said.

10
00:00:39.316 --> 00:00:42.018
"I will hide you in my palanquin.

11
00:00:42.999 --> 00:00:45.341
Then my servants will carry you out of the palace."

12
00:00:45.361 --> 00:00:48.724
"Prepare my palanquin at the backdoor!"

13
00:00:49.385 --> 00:00:51.146
the princess ordered a servant.

14
00:00:51.166 --> 00:00:56.130
"Yes, Your Highness," the servant replied and then hurried off.

15
00:00:57.371 --> 00:01:00.273
Soon the children were following the princess.

16
00:01:01.714 --> 00:01:04.075
Mandy stopped when she heard something.

17
00:01:04.095 --> 00:01:06.355
"Is that a guitar?"

18
00:01:06.696 --> 00:01:07.216
she asked.

19
00:01:08.216 --> 00:01:09.617
Gildong stopped too.

20
00:01:09.637 --> 00:01:14.239
"I think it's a string instrument, a geomungo," he said.

21
00:01:14.259 --> 00:01:16.800
"Only rich people play it."

22
00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:18.300
"Come on!"

23
00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:21.282
The princess waved for them to catch up.

24
00:01:22.542 --> 00:01:24.903
Then she led them to a small courtyard.

25
00:01:25.943 --> 00:01:30.105
Four servants stood waiting there beside a beautiful palanquin.

26
00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:34.947
"They will carry you outside the palace," said the princess.

27
00:01:34.967 --> 00:01:37.568
"So I must say good-bye now."

28
00:01:37.588 --> 00:01:40.529
"Good-bye," said Mandy.

29
00:01:40.549 --> 00:01:42.710
"And thank you!"

30
00:01:44.071 --> 00:01:46.332
Vinnie and Gildong said thanks too.

31
00:01:47.232 --> 00:01:50.113
Then the three of them ducked into the palanquin.

32
00:01:51.154 --> 00:01:54.955
A moment later Mandy felt the palanquin start to move.

33
00:01:54.975 --> 00:01:56.776
"We're off!"

34
00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:57.780
she thought.

35
00:01:59.261 --> 00:02:02.282
Then Vinnie nudged her and showed her the photo.

36
00:02:02.302 --> 00:02:05.624
"Mandy, the photo is glowing blue!"

37
00:02:06.144 --> 00:02:06.904
he whispered.

38
00:02:06.924 --> 00:02:10.546
"But where are the three gates?"

39
00:02:11.046 --> 00:02:12.166
she whispered back.

40
00:02:13.747 --> 00:02:15.508
Soon the palanquin stopped.

41
00:02:16.568 --> 00:02:20.650
When they climbed out, they saw they were outside the palace gates.

42
00:02:21.731 --> 00:02:24.832
The four men bowed and went back to the palace.

43
00:02:26.332 --> 00:02:29.554
"I must go home to do my chores," Gildong said.

44
00:02:29.574 --> 00:02:33.516
"Good-bye!" "Thank you for everything!"

45
00:02:33.996 --> 00:02:36.558
said Vinnie, waving to their new friend.

46
00:02:36.578 --> 00:02:39.399
"Good-bye!" Mandy added.

47
00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.681
She turned and grabbed Vinnie's arm.

48
00:02:42.701 --> 00:02:44.222
"Come on!

49
00:02:44.562 --> 00:02:46.703
Let's see if these are the right gates."

50
00:02:47.844 --> 00:02:50.305
But Vinnie already knew that they were.

51
00:02:51.326 --> 00:02:52.647
He looked at the photo.

52
00:02:53.567 --> 00:02:54.708
It was glowing red.

53
00:02:57.516 --> 00:02:58.557
"We're going home!"

54
00:02:59.097 --> 00:02:59.858
he whispered.

55
00:03:00.818 --> 00:03:02.880
The children fell into the tunnel.

56
00:03:04.141 --> 00:03:07.643
When they opened their eyes again, they were back in the attic.

57
00:03:09.044 --> 00:03:11.966
Mandy put the photo back inside the album.

58
00:03:11.986 --> 00:03:17.970
"That palanquin ride reminded me of our Japan trip," she said.

59
00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:21.332
"Yes," Vinnie said, nodding.

60
00:03:21.352 --> 00:03:27.156
"There's only one more page in the album," she said slowly.

61
00:03:28.676 --> 00:03:30.617
"I know," he answered.

62
00:03:30.637 --> 00:03:36.519
"That means there's just one more photo trip left," Mandy added.

63
00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:39.361
Vinnie didn't say anything.

64
00:03:40.361 --> 00:03:41.242
He just nodded.

65
00:03:42.282 --> 00:03:45.904
Then he turned away to hide the sad look on his face.
